! =====================================================================
!  HERCULE — esquema de colores de terminal (xterm / urxvt)
!  Instalar:  xrdb -merge hercule.Xresources
!  Para GNOME Terminal / Tilix / Kitty / Alacritty ver README-terminal.md
! =====================================================================

*background:   #0A0E0A
*foreground:   #C8D6C8
*cursorColor:  #39FF14

! negro / gris
*color0:  #0A0E0A
*color8:  #2A3A2A
! rojo
*color1:  #FF3B30
*color9:  #FF6B60
! verde (marca)
*color2:  #39FF14
*color10: #7CFF5C
! amarillo / naranja (acento)
*color3:  #FF6A00
*color11: #FFA14D
! azul
*color4:  #2D9CDB
*color12: #5FB8E8
! magenta
*color5:  #B86BFF
*color13: #CF9BFF
! cian
*color6:  #1FA80B
*color14: #39FF14
! blanco
*color7:  #C8D6C8
*color15: #FFFFFF
